{"version":1,"content":"<p>「港式奶茶日」將於11月舉行，黑白淡奶聯同全港100間指定茶餐廳將於11月2日至30日（逢周一至周五），於指定時間免費派發共10,000杯港式奶茶［100間茶餐廳名單］。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:05.607300+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":85,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T00:31:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T01:20:44.902955+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064602+00:00","content_hash":"deab1e470518f0caef131b29e929f4f9f80b7cc984626614d3c0ed66ddb2e735","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}